{
  "extends": "./tsconfig.json",
  "compilerOptions": {
    "lib": ["ES2023", "DOM", "DOM.Iterable"],
    "jsx": "react-jsx",
    "types": ["node"]
  },
  /*
    **必须显式清空 `exclude`。** 根 tsconfig 的 exclude 里有 `apps/web` /
    `packages/ui` / `packages/web-react` / `packages/slots` / `packages/modules`
    —— 那是给内核侧那份配置用的（那边没有 DOM、没有 jsx）。子配置 `extends` 之后
    **include 会被覆盖, exclude 不会** —— 于是这份前端配置把上面那几个目录全排除掉了,
    `typecheck:web` 实际上一个前端文件都没检查（2026-11-16 才发现: 一个不存在的
    标识符也能"0 错"通过）。这里显式清空, 边界才真的落在 include 上。
  */
  "exclude": [],
  "include": [
    "types/**/*.d.ts",
    "apps/web/src/**/*.ts",
    "apps/web/src/**/*.tsx",
    "packages/core/src/**/*.ts",
    "packages/modules/src/**/*.ts",
    "packages/shell/src/**/*.ts",
    "packages/shell/test/**/*.ts",
    "packages/slots/src/**/*.ts",
    "packages/slots/test/**/*.ts",
    "packages/ui/src/**/*.ts",
    "packages/ui/src/**/*.tsx",
    "packages/web-react/src/**/*.ts",
    "packages/web-react/src/**/*.tsx",
    "packages/transport/src/**/*.ts",
    "packages/platform/src/**/*.ts"
  ]
}
